Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:26:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Close verified policy snapshots before late responses can
 mutate authority state

---
 ROOT-REVIEW.md                         | 16 +++++++++
 network/verified-chain.mjs             | 31 +++++++++++------
 test/verified-chain-lifecycle.test.mjs | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 82 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)
